    "description": "The Food Delivery Driver List API enables businesses to retrieve a comprehensive list of delivery drivers associated with food delivery services. This endpoint allows consumers, such as delivery management systems and food service applications, to access real-time data on available drivers, enhancing operational efficiency and logistics planning. Developers can integrate this functionality to improve driver matching processes, track availability, and optimize delivery routes, ensuring a seamless customer experience. Utilize this API to stay informed about the status and capacity of your delivery workforce.",
